{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Code Trainer</strong>\u00a0is a coding practice tool for people that already know how to code. Solve problems, complete quizzes, and refresh your understanding about common computer science topics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS GAME WILL NOT TEACH YOU HOW TO CODE</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Code</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 problems</strong> of varying difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports <strong>C#, Java, JavaScript, </strong>and <strong>Python</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Internet connection required</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: There is no auto-complete or error highlighting in the code editor. It's just you and the code.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quiz</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Been a while since you've brushed up on the basics? Engage in different quizzes to make sure you have well-rounded knowledge of various computer science topics. Use these to identify what your weaknesses are. Don't know the answer? Great! That means it's an opportunity to learn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Review concise courses about Data Structures, Algorithms, and more with interactive features to solidify your conceptual understanding. This is not &quot;Learn everything about coding from scratch&quot;.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Python","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279360/9cf9b9deca4d3c032544330e4aeba6e65be4ccdd.jpg"},{"name":"C#","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279360/9cf9b9deca4d3c032544330e4aeba6e65be4ccdd.jpg"},{"name":"Java","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279360/9cf9b9deca4d3c032544330e4aeba6e65be4ccdd.jpg"},{"name":"JavaScript","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/i